        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>打岔别人的报告 - No.35</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Hiragino Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #f2f0eb;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    background: #f2f0eb;\n    padding: 15px 15px 25px 15px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-left: 90px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .no-tag {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 30px;\n    left: 10px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #2a4d8f;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive, sans-serif;\n    transform: rotate(-8deg);\n  }\n  .dialogue-columns {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    padding: 0 5px;\n  }\n  .dialogue-col {\n    color: #2a4d8f;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    width: 48%;\n  }\n  .dialogue-col.right {\n    padding-left: 15px;\n  }\n  .illustration-wrap {\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 15px auto 5px auto;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 500px;\n    height: 350px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      45deg,\n      #e9e7e0,\n      #e9e7e0 10px,\n      #ded9cf 10px,\n      #ded9cf 20px\n    );\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .bleed-through {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 340px;\n    width: 40px;\n    color: #b9c3e0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n  }\n  .jp-paragraph {\n    color: #2a4d8f;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 15px 10px 10px 10px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .final-paragraph {\n    color: #111;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 15px 10px 0 10px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"no-tag\">No.35</div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-block\">\n    打岔别人的报告，然后重新把舞台交给他，ひとの報告をさえぎり、その後、<br>\n    再開させる（カニエ・ウェストみたいに）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"dialogue-columns\">\n    <div class=\"dialogue-col left\">\n      安东尼，你稍等下<br>\n      大家安静下<br>\n      接下来安东尼要发表我们<br>\n      的第四季度目标报告了，<br>\n      大家要认真听哦!<br>\n      那么安东尼，请继续。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dialogue-col right\">\n      アンソニー、ちょっとストップ<br>\n      ねえみんな。<br>\n      アンソニーが私たちの<br>\n      四半期目標について報告するから、<br>\n      ちゃんと聞いてね<br>\n      じゃあアンソニー、続けて\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"illustration-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: two people seated at a table talking, one man giving a thumbs-up, a cup on the table between them]</div>\n    <div class=\"bleed-through\">路んでいた んと励 とに指摘され うにしと</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"jp-paragraph\">\n    だれかがプロジェクトについて報告をはじめたら、それをさえぎって、この報告がどれほど大事かみんなに知らせる。そして、報告者に続けるよう言う。一瞬にしてあなたは会議の支配者となる。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"final-paragraph\">\n    当别人准备进行项目报告的时候，抢险打岔他的报告，然后告诉大家这个报告有多重要。再让发言者继续发表报告。一瞬间你就可以成为这个会议的主宰者。\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
